---
// Join the Founding Team Section
---
<section class="join" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="join-grid">
      <div class="join-copy">
        <h2 id="join-heading">Help shape a clinic from the start.</h2>
        <p>
          We are assembling a small, capable founding team, and we would love to hear from clinicians who want to help shape a clinic from the start rather than join a finished one.
        </p>
        <p class="roles">
          Consultant psychiatrists (Fellows of the Royal Australian and New Zealand College of Psychiatrists, FRANZCP), TMS technicians and nurses, psychologists, and clinician researchers with an interest in neurostimulation.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sessional, part time and collaborative arrangements are all on the table, and we would rather wait for the right people than rush.
        </p>
        <div class="join-cta">
          <a href="#register" class="btn btn-primary">Register your interest</a>
          <!-- Live SEEK ad with WCAG AA compliant link token & external icon -->
          <a
            class="seek"
            href="https://au.seek.com/job/94480835?ref=cm-ui"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="View our current psychiatrist opportunity on SEEK (opens in a new tab)"
          >
            <span>View our current psychiatrist opportunity on SEEK</span>
            <svg class="external-ic" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path>
              <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline>
              <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="join-art">
        <img
          src="/images/join/collaborative-clinical-cohort.webp"
          alt="Abstract artwork representing collaborative psychiatric leadership and multidisciplinary clinical foundation"
          width="1200"
          height="896"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
